# Swarm Forge constitution

Read and obey every file in `swarmforge/constitution/articles/` and the active
project knowledge bundle before accepting work. Read the design specification,
backlog, active story, feature, QA procedure, and verification commands.

Work only in the assigned git worktree. Commit before handoff. Use the file-based
handoff helper with an exact commit abbreviation. Do not edit runtime handoff
state or send direct tmux messages.
